# QA (M2, D-045): a relaxed full run of Stage 3 at walking pace (handwritten,
# no solver prefix, never runs). Uferweg: bumps the M-box, waits for the
# Mozartkugel (PowerUp), over the rock wall, waits on the boulder until
# E-Biker #1 crashes into it, stomps walker #1. Kornmuehle: over the mill
# race, onto the hive and under swarm #1, climbs the mill and takes bonus 1
# on the ridge, stomps the tourist below, bumps the ?-box from below as
# Zuckerschock. Bienenhaus: stops left of swarm #2's reach, waits ~3 s,
# walks under it to the free column 102, hops on the 1-high hive, onto the
# stack behind walker #2 and stomps it, up onto the right bee-house roof (6
# Oblaten). Re-cut from here in the M2 level pass (tourist moved from the
# garden to the paved path, chimney, boathouse, 3-gap at 215-217; the rest
# found with a walking-only search, so it waits less than the original QA
# run): Fuenf Haeuser: drops off the roof, checkpoint, stomps the
# Selfie-Tourist on the paved path and the charging E-Biker #2, climbs
# house 2 and stomps walker #3, over house 3 and the garden while swarm #4
# dances up-right, onto house 4, bumps the Zaunerstollen box (it rolls into
# the chimney and back: ExtraLife), stomps E-Biker #3 in the garden, over
# house 5 behind walker #4. Badesteg: walking jumps over both gaps, climbs
# the boathouse and walks off its roof to the pole (100). Never hurt.
# Maibaum touch at frame 3586 = 59.8 s (D-045: 3 x 59.8 -> 180, clamped
# to the 200 s minimum: Brunnwinkl keeps 200).
